BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Three Prerequisites: Truth\, Faith\, Love
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260930T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260930T213000
UID:d4052d4929d3d315cdcfff37@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Maitreyabandhu\, a senior member of the Triratna Buddhist Orde
 r\, will be exploring the Three Prerequisites\, the fundamental qualities 
