BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free Your Mind
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261003T103000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261003T123000
UID:6c65dd9c4fb4f22b3b999774@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:The state of our mind is the state of our life. We're mostly u
 naware of how our negative habits limit our experience and are oblivious t
 o the vast potential of our minds. Buddhist practice gives us the tools to
  change that and awaken to life’s depths. On the course\, we will teach 
 you some of the fundamentals of Buddhist thought\, as well as two foundati
 onal meditation practices.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/free-your-mind-deptford
END:VEVENT
